    <briefdescription>
<para>Linux-compatible event notification file descriptor (&lt;<ref refid="eventfd_8h" kindref="compound">sys/eventfd.h</ref>&gt;) </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>eventfd provides a lightweight, kernel-managed counter that can be used for event notification between threads or between a kernel component and user space. It integrates with poll/select/epoll.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>eventfd is a Linux extension, not part of POSIX.1-2017, but is widely available on Linux and implemented here for compatibility. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
